{"title":"C++:Downloads","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Microsoft_Visual_C.2B.2B_Express\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Microsoft_Visual_C++_Express\">Microsoft Visual C++ Express</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=C%2B%2B:Downloads&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Microsoft Visual C++ Express\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Microsoft Visual C++ Express is a free, lightweight compiler for C++ programming.\n</p><p>To install Microsoft Visual Studio with Visual C++ Express:\n</p>\n<ol><li>Click <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/\">here</a> to download the compiler.</li></ol>\n<ol><li>Download the Visual C++ Express version by clicking <b>\"Install Now - English\"</b>.</li></ol>\n<ol><li>Locate the downloaded file and double-click it to start the installation.</li></ol>\n<ol><li>Follow the instructions in the installer to complete the setup.</li></ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018075000\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11183:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018075000 and revision id 249095. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}